OL,3,GNEWSAFire alarm causes rush hour rail
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire alarm at Birmingham's railway
OL,7,Fsignalling centre has caused major
OL,8,Fdisruption during rush hour.
OL,10,FNational Rail said it was reported at
OL,11,F16:44 BST on Monday and caused trains
OL,12,Fin and out of the city to be delayed or
OL,13,Fcancelled.
OL,15,FAll lines reopened by 16:47 BST but
OL,16,FNational Rail said the disruption was
OL,17,Flikely to continue until 21:00 BST the
OL,18,Fsame day.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
